  "body": "In [POST /_matrix/client/r0/account/3pid](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/unstable#post-matrix-client-r0-account-3pid), there is an example response:\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"submit_url\": \"https://example.org/path/to/submitToken\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nthat suggests the API could return a `submit_url`, but this seems like a spec bug, as it doesn't make sense to have a submit URL here.",
